      "created": 1788233455,
      "updated": 1788233455
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9646ee000000000055bed3",
      "text": "とは一体……[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788233455,
      "updated": 1788233464
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9646f0000000000055bed4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788233457,
      "updated": 1788233457
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9647130000000000b19240",
      "text": "いーや、Adminこそ王だね",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788233493,
      "updated": 1788233508
    },
    {
      "id": "6a968e980000000000d2e99e",
      "text": "\tAdminが 王なら Owner は何なのか[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788251800,
      "updated": 1788251835
    },
    {
      "id": "6a968ee80000000000c420e6",
      "text": "\t スパルタみたいに王が複数いるのかも[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1788251880,
      "updated": 1788251891
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9647180000000000b19241",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788233498,
      "updated": 1788233498
    },
    {
      "id": "6a964b5f0000000000193763",
      "text": "[自分のアイコンに飾りをつけるUserCSS]をアレンジして👑をつけるといい感じになりそう[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1788234592,
      "updated": 1788234620
    },
    {
      "id": "6a964b650000000000193764",
      "text": "",
