      "created": 1788234597,
      "updated": 1788234597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96500000000000005cd107",
      "text": " 井戸端帝（皇帝）",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1788235777,
      "updated": 1788236048
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96503800000000005cd10b",
      "text": "  井戸端王を統べる者[KNo.804C.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1788235833,
      "updated": 1788236187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96501200000000005cd10a",
      "text": " 井戸端神",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1788235796,
      "updated": 1788235858
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96513300000000005cd10e",
      "text": "  井戸端を創造せし者[KNo.804C.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1788236084,
      "updated": 1788236265
    },
    {
      "id": "6a968ee60000000000d2e9a0",
      "text": "  owner これだわ[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788251878,
      "updated": 1788251885
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96500100000000005cd108",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1788235778,
      "updated": 1788235778
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9655f80000000000c4c39f",
      "text": "王は「おう」と呼ばず「キング」と呼びたいが、イドバタキング、は語感が微妙[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788237304,
      "updated": 1788237329
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9656100000000000c4c3a1",
      "text": "\t省略してバタキング？しっくりこない",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788237329,
      "updated": 1788237349
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9656390000000000c4c3a2",
      "text": "\t省く場所を調整、イドバタだからドバキング？スカイリムの匂いがしてくるから何か違う",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788237370,
      "updated": 1788237415
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96597e000000000016ff45",
      "text": "\tバタキン？[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788238207,
      "updated": 1788238221
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96598e000000000016ff46",
      "text": "\t これだとバターの王になってしまうか？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788238222,
      "updated": 1788238239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a966d02000000000076ce6a",
      "text": "\t「海賊王」みたいな雰囲気があって井戸端王もわりとすき[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1788243202,
      "updated": 1788243217
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96aa580000000000fe11f7",
      "text": "\tイドバタキングダムはちょっとリズムが良い",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788258905,
      "updated": 1788258940
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96abeb0000000000fe11fb",
      "text": "\t6文字なら気持ち良いかもしれない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788259308,
      "updated": 1788259318
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96abf50000000000fe11fc",
      "text": "\t ドバタキング",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788259318,
      "updated": 1788259323
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965a04000000000016ff48",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788238341,
      "updated": 1788238343
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96599f000000000016ff47",
      "text": "井戸端王→井戸の帝王→well lord→ウェルロード[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788238239,
      "updated": 1788238347
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965a0c000000000016ff49",
      "text": " もうコウテイ[イドバタニシ]でいいんじゃないですかね",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788238349,
      "updated": 1788238392
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9655f90000000000c4c3a0",
      "text": "[キングタニシ]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1788237306,
      "updated": 1788260217
    },
    {
      "id": "6a968ed70000000000d2e99f",
      "text": "コウテイタニシ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788251863,
      "updated": 1788251867
    },
    {
      "id": "6a968fd0000000000028a5d0",
      "text": "[タニシガチャ]で出てくるやつだ[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1788252112,
      "updated": 1788260683
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9690860000000000e735a2",
      "text": "\tハズレ枠にはジャンボタニシかな？[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788252295,
      "updated": 1788252303
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96abbb0000000000fe11fa",
      "text": "他にも仲間が居るかもしれない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788259260,
      "updated": 1788259270
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9671810000000000ab2556",
      "text": " タニシナイト",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788244354,
      "updated": 1788259260
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96aa960000000000fe11f9",
      "text": " [ホイミタニシ]",
